    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vōmer</span></b> , ĕris
		(collat. form of the <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>nom. sing.</i>
