		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> = membrum virile, <i><span class="en">Lucr. 4,
				1269</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A style</i> for writing with, Atta ap.
					<i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 6, 9</span></i>.</div>
